  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "2.2.0: new StarNameGenerator and IStarNameGenerator for real star names: 640 IAU proper names (Sirius, Betelgeuse), 3,076 Bayer and Flamsteed designations covering every naked-eye star (Tau Ceti, 61 Cygni), and 343,518 Henry Draper and Hipparcos catalogue designations (HD 209458, HIP 70890); Random extension methods GenerateRandomStarName and GenerateMultipleStarNames. Full history: https://github.com/m4bwav/DotNetRandomNameGenerator/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md",
